    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "audiens caritatem tuam, et fidem, quam habes in Domino Jesu, et in omnes sanctos:",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/phlm#Phlm.1.6",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "ut communicatio fidei tuæ evidens fiat in agnitione omnis operis boni, quod est in vobis in Christo Jesu.",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/phlm#Phlm.1.7",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Gaudium enim magnum habui, et consolationem in caritate tua: quia viscera sanctorum requieverunt per te, frater.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/phlm#Phlm.1.8",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Propter quod multam fiduciam habens in Christo Jesu imperandi tibi quod ad rem pertinet:",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
